"Interesting Notch includes a mirror feature that lets you quickly check your appearance using your camera, right from the notch. Camera access is required only to show this live preview. You can turn the mirror feature on or off at any time in the app." = "Interesting Notch 提供镜像功能，可直接通过摄像头在刘海区域查看自己的画面。仅显示此实时预览时才会使用摄像头，且可随时在应用内关闭。";
"Interesting Notch can show all your upcoming events in one place. Access to your calendar is needed to display your schedule." = "Interesting Notch 可集中显示即将到来的日程，需要访问日历才能显示你的安排。";
"Interesting Notch can show your scheduled reminders alongside your calendar events. Access to Reminders is needed to display your reminders." = "Interesting Notch 可将提醒事项与日历日程一同显示，需要访问提醒事项才能显示它们。";
"Accessibility access is required to replace system notifications with the Interesting Notch HUD. This allows the app to intercept media and brightness events to display custom HUD overlays." = "要用 Interesting Notch HUD 替代系统通知，需要辅助功能权限。它用于拦截媒体与亮度事件并显示自定义 HUD。";
